    rdf:value """Sunday, May 17, 1908 
Albergo Bixio, Castelvetrano.
Very hot.
Started at 8.30 and saw  Sciacca , with a very interesting Madonna by Laurana, very wicked looking, and some  Gaginis . Got to Selinunte for tea, and had a gorgeous sunset and view. I felt rather sick, and must have had a  coup de soleil , for it was frightfully hot, and we did not lunch till 2."""^^xsd:string ;
    mbdiaries-ontology:index 160 ;
    mbdiaries-ontology:part_of <https://mbdiaries.itatti.harvard.edu/resource/diary/1908> .

